{"id":"wild","lemma":"wild","pos":"adj","rank":1579,"glosses":["wild (of animals, etc.)","wild, unrestrained, raucous (of behavior, parties, etc.)","crazy, hard to believe (of stories, situations, etc.)"],"ipa":"/vɪlt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6d/De-at-wild.ogg/De-at-wild.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"wilder","superlative":"am wildesten"},"formAudio":{"wilder":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/94/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Jeuwre-Wilder.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Diese Mädchen sind wild.","en":"These girls are wild.","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"girl"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Sein Herz schlug wie wild.","en":"His heart was beating wildly.","words":[{"g":"to be"},{"g":"heart"},{"g":"to beat","l":"schlagen"},{"g":"how"},null]},{"text":"Ein wilder Hund fiel das Mädchen an.","en":"A fierce dog attacked the girl.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"dog, hound"},{"g":"to fall, to drop","l":"fallen"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"girl"},{"g":"at / on"}]},{"text":"Sie ist ganz wild auf Kuchen.","en":"She loves cake.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/389423","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"entire"},null,{"g":"on"},{"g":"pie"}]},{"text":"Die Angst machte sie fast wild.","en":"Her anxiety almost drove her wild.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"fear"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"almost"},null]}]}